      "tamil_reading_title": "“ஜாக்குலின்கள்”",
      "english_title": "# 1. “Jacquelines”"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0002",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நீ விளைத்த கழனி - நீ உழைத்த உழைப்பு!",
      "english_title": "# 2. The Field You Cultivated — The Labour You Gave!"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0003",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நிதானமாகப் பேசுங்கள்!",
      "english_title": "# 3. Speak with Restraint!"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0004",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "உன்னால் முடிந்ததைச் செய்து விட்டாயா?",
      "english_title": "# 4. Have You Done All the Harm You Could?"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0005",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நேர்மையும் பொறுப்பும் நீர்மேல் எழுத்தல்ல!",
      "english_title": "# 5. Integrity and Responsibility Are Not Writing upon Water!"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0006",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "வெற்றி பெற்றவனே உன் வேலை என்ன?",
      "english_title": "# 6. Victor, What Is Your Work Now?"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0007",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "தோற்ற முயலே! முன்போல சுறுசுறுப்பாக இரு!",
      "english_title": "# 7. Defeated Hare! Be as Energetic as Before!"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0008",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“தீராதி தீரர்- தேசீய மகிபர்- பராக்! பராக்!”",
      "english_title": "# 8. Peerless Hero — National Sovereign — Parāk! Parāk!"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0009",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "வீரனே! வெற்றி என்றைக்கும் உன் பக்கம்தான்!",
      "english_title": "# 9. Valiant One! Victory Will Always Be on Your Side!"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0010",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "பாவி கெடுத்தானே; பலே சாப்பாட்டை!",
      "english_title": "# 10. The Sinner Ruined a Splendid Meal!"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0011",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "தென்றல்- தெம்பாங்கு- தேன்கீதம்!",
      "english_title": "# 11. Breeze, Themmangu, Honeyed Song!"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0012",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“பூப்போட்ட கிளாசிலே போட்டய்யா ஒண்ணரை!”",
      "english_title": "# 12. “In the Flower-Patterned Glass, Pour Me One-and-a-Half!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0013",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "மேயர் தேர்தல் நேரம் - நிலை - நேர்த்தியான முடிவு!",
      "english_title": "# 13. The Mayoral Election: A Fitting Decision for the Time and Circumstances!"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0014",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "‘பகைமரம்’ தழைக்க விடோம்!",
      "english_title": "# 14. We Shall Not Let the “Tree of Enmity” Flourish!"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0015",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நம்பிக்கையில்லாத் தீர்மானம் - நாடாளுமன்ற நிகழ்ச்சி!",
      "english_title": "# 15. No-Confidence Motion: An Incident in Parliament!"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0016",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "யார் அந்த உணவு அமைச்சர்?",
      "english_title": "# 16. Who Was That Food Minister?"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0017",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "கிளம்பிற்றுக்காண் தமிழச் சிங்கக் கூட்டம்!",
      "english_title": "# 17. Behold, the Band of Tamil Lions Has Set Forth!"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0018",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "கழுதையும் - பன்றியும்!",
      "english_title": "# 18. The Donkey and the Pig!"
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0019",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“பசுத்தோல் வேங்கை பாராய்!”",
      "english_title": "# 19. Behold the Tiger in Cowhide!"
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0020",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“தமிழ்த்தாயே அவர்களை மன்னித்துவிடு!”",
      "english_title": "# 20. Mother Tamil, Forgive Them!"
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0021",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "‘தமிழ் நாடு’ ஒரு முழு விளக்கம்!",
      "english_title": "# 21. A Full Explanation of “Tamil Nadu”!"
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0022",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "கண்கள் திறக்க ஒரு கதை!",
      "english_title": "# 22. A Story to Open Your Eyes!"
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0023",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "பரிதாபப்படுகிறேன்!",
      "english_title": "# 23. I Pity You!"
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0024",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“அரசியல் மோசடியாம் - அறிவிக்கிறார்; ஆழ்வப் பிறவி!”",
      "english_title": "# 24. “Political Fraud,” Proclaims This Rare Specimen!"
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0025",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "இந்தியும் மொரார்ஜி தேசாயும்!",
      "english_title": "# 25. Hindi and Morarji Desai!"
    },
    {
      "order": 26,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0026",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "தகுந்த பாடம் தரவேண்டாமா?",
      "english_title": "# 26. Should We Not Teach Them a Fitting Lesson?"
    },
    {
      "order": 27,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0027",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "காட்சி காண அல்ல - களம் காண!",
      "english_title": "# 27. Not to See the Sights, but to Enter the Field!"
    },
    {
      "order": 28,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0028",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "வெண்மணிச் சம்பவம் ஒரு விளக்கம்!",
      "english_title": "# 28. An Explanation of the Venmani Incident!"
    },
    {
      "order": 29,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0029",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "காங்கிரஸ் வெற்றியும் இந்தித் திணிப்பும்!",
      "english_title": "# 29. Congress Victory and Hindi Imposition!"
    },
    {
      "order": 30,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0030",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "பாழடைந்த மண்டபமும் வெளவால்களும்!",
      "english_title": "# 30. The Ruined Hall and the Bats!"
    },
    {
      "order": 31,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0031",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "வேங்கை போடும் வெள்ளாடு வேடம்!",
      "english_title": "# 31. A Tiger in a Goat's Disguise!"
    },
    {
      "order": 32,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0032",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "காமராஜரின் கடற்கரைப் பேச்சின் பொருள் என்ன?",
      "english_title": "# 32. What Does Kamaraj's Marina Speech Mean?"
    },
    {
      "order": 33,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0033",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "தெளிந்திடும் நீரோடை!",
      "english_title": "# 33. The Troubled Stream Will Run Clear!"
    },
    {
      "order": 34,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0034",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "வென்றிட வேறு யாருளர்?",
      "english_title": "# 34. Who Else Can Defeat Us?"
    },
    {
      "order": 35,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0035",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "உனக்காக விழித்திருப்போம்!",
      "english_title": "# 35. We Shall Stay Awake for You!"
    },
    {
      "order": 36,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0036",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“கிழச் சிங்கம், கிளறிய நெஞ்சம்!”",
      "english_title": "# 36. “The Old Lion, and a Heart Stirred!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 37,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0037",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": false,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நீயும் நானும் தூங்குவோமா?",
      "english_title": "# 37. Shall You and I Sleep?"
    },
    {
      "order": 38,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0038",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "இன்றே தொடங்கிடுக பணி!",
      "english_title": "# 38. Begin the Work Today!"
    },
    {
      "order": 39,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0039",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“கோவை - ஒரு கனி! நீ ஒரு கிளி!”",
      "english_title": "# 39. “Coimbatore Is a Fruit; You Are a Parrot!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 40,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0040",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "அண்ணன்-கண்ணன் எங்கே?",
      "english_title": "# 40. Where Is Elder Brother Kannan?"
    },
    {
      "order": 41,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0041",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நான் கேட்கும் பிச்சை!",
      "english_title": "# 41. The Alms I Ask of You!"
    },
    {
      "order": 42,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0042",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "ஜூலை 15!",
      "english_title": "# 42. July 15!"
    },
    {
      "order": 43,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0043",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "பெருமை எது?",
      "english_title": "# 43. What Is Our Pride?"
    },
    {
      "order": 44,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0044",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "வழக்கு ஜோடனை!",
      "english_title": "# 44. A Case Concocted!"
    },
    {
      "order": 45,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0045",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "மதுரை மாட்சி (1)",
      "english_title": "# 45. Madurai’s Grandeur (1)"
    },
    {
      "order": 46,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0046",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "மதுரை மாட்சி (2)",
      "english_title": "# 46. Madurai’s Grandeur (2)"
    },
    {
      "order": 47,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0047",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“தாயே எட்டடி என்றால்...”",
      "english_title": "# 47. “If the Mother Herself Leaps Eight Feet...”"
    },
    {
      "order": 48,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0048",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "பாவம்; பண்பாடு, படும் பாடு!",
      "english_title": "# 48. Poor Civility, What Travails It Suffers!"
    },
    {
      "order": 49,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0049",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "அன்பகம்! அறிவகம்!",
      "english_title": "# 49. An Abode of Love! An Abode of Wisdom!"
    },
    {
      "order": 50,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0050",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நமக்குப் புரியவில்லை!",
      "english_title": "# 50. We Did Not Understand!"
    },
    {
      "order": 51,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0051",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "அகல்விளக்கு கையில் அண்ணன் மொழி நெஞ்சில்!",
      "english_title": "# 51. An Earthen Lamp in Hand; Anna's Words in the Heart!"
    },
    {
      "order": 52,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0052",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "பிப்ரவரி மூன்றாம் நாள்!",
      "english_title": "# 52. The Third Day of February!"
    },
    {
      "order": 53,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0053",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நட வேகமாக! நமக்கே வெற்றி!!",
      "english_title": "# 53. March Swiftly! Victory Is Ours!!"
    },
    {
      "order": 54,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0054",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "ஐந்தாம் ஜார்ஜா? ஆறாம் ஜார்ஜா?",
      "english_title": "# 54. George the Fifth? George the Sixth?"
    },
    {
      "order": 55,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0055",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“அரிதாரம் கலையும்!”",
      "english_title": "# 55. “The Greasepaint Will Wear Off!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 56,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0056",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "சிந்தனைக்கு!",
      "english_title": "# 56. For Reflection!"
    },
    {
      "order": 57,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0057",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“பிறந்த நாள் வேண்டுகோள்!”",
      "english_title": "# 57. “A Birthday Appeal!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 58,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0058",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“நடக்கின்ற ஆச்சரியம்!”",
      "english_title": "# 58. “The Wonder Taking Place!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 59,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0059",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "இதுதான் உலகம்!",
      "english_title": "# 59. Such Is the World!"
    },
    {
      "order": 60,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0060",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“கண்ணீர் மடல்!”",
      "english_title": "# 60. “A Letter Written in Tears!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 61,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0061",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“ஒழுங்கான கணக்கு!”",
      "english_title": "# 61. “The Proper Reckoning!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 62,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0062",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "உண்மை! உண்மை!!",
      "english_title": "# 62. Truth! Truth!!"
    },
    {
      "order": 63,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0063",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“கிலுகிலுப்பை!”",
      "english_title": "# 63. “The Rattle!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 64,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0064",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "பதவி-துறவி!",
      "english_title": "# 64. The Ascetic of Office!"
    },
    {
      "order": 65,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0065",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "உன் பெயர் எங்கே?",
      "english_title": "# 65. Where Is Your Name?"
    },
    {
      "order": 66,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0066",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“அண்ணன் எழுதிய மடல்!”",
      "english_title": "# 66. “The Letter Anna Wrote!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 67,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0067",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நடக்கட்டும் நாடகம்!",
      "english_title": "# 67. Let the Drama Go On!"
    },
    {
      "order": 68,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0068",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“டெல்லி லாயத்தில்!”",
      "english_title": "# 68. “In Delhi’s Stable!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 69,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0069",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "படையெடுப்பு பலிக்குமா?",
      "english_title": "# 69. Will the Offensive Succeed?"
    },
    {
      "order": 70,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0070",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "உணரச் செய்வோம்!",
      "english_title": "# 70. Let Us Explain!"
    },
    {
      "order": 71,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0071",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "காலக் கருவூலம்!",
      "english_title": "# 71. A Treasury of Time!"
    },
    {
      "order": 72,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0072",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "ஒன்று சொல்க!",
      "english_title": "# 72. Tell Them One Thing!"
    },
    {
      "order": 73,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0073",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "புன்னகையும் பெருமூச்சும்!",
      "english_title": "# 73. A Smile and a Sigh!"
    },
    {
      "order": 74,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0074",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "குறள் மறவோம்!",
      "english_title": "# 74. Let Us Not Forget the Kural!"
    },
    {
      "order": 75,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0075",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "உன் எதிரே!",
      "english_title": "# 75. Before You!"
    },
    {
      "order": 76,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0076",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "தட்டிக் கேட்கலாமா?",
      "english_title": "# 76. May We Not Demand an Answer?"
    },
    {
      "order": 77,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0077",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "பெரியாரின் வெற்றி!",
      "english_title": "# 77. Periyar’s Victory!"
    },
    {
      "order": 78,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0078",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நம்மை வென்றாரா?",
      "english_title": "# 78. Did He Win Us Over?"
    },
    {
      "order": 79,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0079",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "இருபதாயிரம் பாடி வீடுகள்!",
      "english_title": "# 79. Twenty Thousand Military Camps!"
    },
    {
      "order": 80,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0080",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "கொள்கை மலர்கள்",
      "english_title": "# 80. Flowers of Principle"
    },
    {
      "order": 81,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0081",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "தெள்ளிய ஆலின் சிறு பழத்தொரு விதை!",
      "english_title": "# 81. A Seed from the Tiny Fruit of the Stately Banyan!"
    },
    {
      "order": 82,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0082",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "பொங்கல் உறுதி!",
      "english_title": "# 82. A Pongal Pledge!"
    },
    {
      "order": 83,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0083",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "காண வருகிறேன் உன்னை!",
      "english_title": "# 83. I Am Coming to See You!"
    },
    {
      "order": 84,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0084",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "‘தொய்வு இல்லை! தொடர்க பயணம்!’",
      "english_title": "# 84. “No Weariness! Let the Journey Continue!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 85,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0085",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“எல்லா மலர்களும் ரோஜா மலர்களே!”",
      "english_title": "# 85. “Every Flower Is a Rose!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 86,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0086",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "மே தின வாழ்த்து!",
      "english_title": "# 86. May Day Greetings!"
    },
    {
      "order": 87,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0087",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "‘நமது நிலை’!",
      "english_title": "# 87. “Our Position”!"
    },
    {
      "order": 88,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0088",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "என் பிறந்த நாளில்...!",
      "english_title": "# 88. On My Birthday...!"
    },
    {
      "order": 89,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0089",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": false,
      "tamil_reading_title": "“மறவாதே!”",
      "english_title": "# 89. “Do Not Forget!”"
    },
    {
      "order": 90,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0090",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "கோடையிலே...!",
      "english_title": "# 90. In the Summer...!"
    },
    {
      "order": 91,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0091",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
      "translator_note_count": 1,
      "has_udanpirappe": true,
      "source_uses_udanpirappe": true,
      "tamil_reading_title": "நமது விழாக்கள்!",
      "english_title": "# 91. Our Celebrations!"
    },
    {
      "order": 92,
      "chapter_id": "m1-l0092",
      "source_hash_matches": true,
      "english_section_count": 1,
      "tamil_section_count": 1,
